<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy 1st Anniversary kannaaaaaaaaaaaa💞</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4d88,#ff9ecf,#ffe6f2);
overflow-x:hidden;
color:white;
text-align:center;
}

#hearts{
position:fixed;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
z-index:0;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
font-size:22px;
animation:float 8s linear infinite;
opacity:.8;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{
transform:translateY(100vh) scale(.8);
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-120px) scale(1.4);
}
}

.container{
position:relative;
z-index:10;
padding:40px 20px;
}

h1{
font-family:"Dancing Script",cursive;
font-size:58px;
margin-top:30px;
text-shadow:2px 2px 15px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
}

h2{
margin-top:15px;
font-weight:500;
}

.startBtn{
margin-top:35px;
padding:16px 40px;
border:none;
border-radius:50px;
background:white;
color:#ff2f75;
font-size:20px;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
transition:.3s;
}

.startBtn:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

.section{
display:none;
animation:fade 1s;
}

@keyframes fade{
from{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(30px);
}
to{
opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);

}
}
.gallery{
display:none;
padding:30px 15px;
}

.card{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);
backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
border-radius:25px;
padding:20px;
margin:20px auto;
max-width:380px;
box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}

.card img{
width:100%;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
}

.caption{
margin-top:15px;
font-size:18px;
font-weight:500;
}

.nextBtn{
margin-top:25px;
padding:14px 35px;
border:none;
border-radius:40px;
background:white;
color:#ff2f75;
font-size:18px;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div id="hearts"></div>

<div class="container">

<div id="home">

<h1> Happy 1st Anniversary 💖</h1>

<h2>Avinash 💗 Mallika</h2>

<p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:20px;">
Every Love Story is Beautiful...<br>
But Ours is My Favorite. 💞
</p>

<button class="startBtn" onclick="openGallery()">
🎁 Open My Gift
</button>

</div>

<div class="gallery" id="gallery">

<div class="card">
<img src="IMG_20260705_034441_562.jpg">
<div class="caption">💖 Every smile with you is my favorite memory.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="IMG_20260705_034647_063.jpg">
<div class="caption">🌹 Every moment with you is priceless.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="IMG_20260705_034753_217.jpg">
<div class="caption">💕 You are my today, tomorrow and forever.</div>
</div>

<button class="nextBtn" onclick="showLetter()">
💌 Read My Letter
</button>

</div>
<div class="section" id="letter">

<h1>💌 A Letter For You 💌</h1>

<div class="card">

<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:2;">

To My Dearest <b>Avinashhhhhh ❤️</b><br><br>

Happy First Anniversary, My Love... 💖<br><br>

You are the most valuable possession in this world to me.

I always loved you, and I always will.

Through every hardship, every happiness, and every challenge, I promise I will never leave your hand.

Thank you for filling my life with beautiful memories.

You are my smile...
My peace...
My happiness...
My forever...

I don't know what tomorrow brings, but I know one thing...

<b>I will always choose YOU. ❤️</b>

<br><br>

💖 <b>I LOVE YOU FOREVER NANNAAAAA... 💖</b>

<br><br>

Forever Yours,<br>

<b>Mallika ❤️</b>

</p>

</div>

<button class="nextBtn" onclick="showFinal()">
❤️ One Last Surprise
</button>

</div>

<div class="section" id="final">

<h1>💖 I LOVE YOU FOREVER NANNAAAAA 💖</h1>

<h2>🌹 Happy 1st Anniversary 🌹</h2>

<h2>Avinash ❤️ Mallika</h2>

<p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:22px;">
No matter how many years pass,<br>
You'll always be my favorite person. ❤️
</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:40px;">
Forever & Always 💕
</h2>

</div>

<script>

function openGallery(){
document.getElementById("home").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("gallery").style.display="block";
}

function showLetter(){
document.getElementById("gallery").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("letter").style.display="block";
}

function showFinal(){
document.getElementById("letter").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("final").style.display="block";
}

setInterval(function(){

let heart=document.createElement("div");

heart.className="heart";

heart.innerHTML="💖";

heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

heart.style.animationDuration=(Math.random()*5+5)+"s";

document.getElementById("hearts").appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},9000);

},300);

</script>

</body>

</html>
